  "tips": [
    "Use as many marches as possible and send troops to online alliance members for higher scores.",
    "Send infantry first, then lancers when infantry runs out. Avoid marksmen, which add little.",
    "At the end of waves 9 and 19, recall strong hero marches to headquarters (90% infantry, 10% lancers).",
    "Send marches to friends with few reinforcements to gain more personal points.",
    "Do not heal injured troops, so that internal troops do not steal kills from reinforcements.",
    "Make sure reinforced friends have sent their own troops away to prevent kill stealing.",
    "Activate all pets and buffs for more kills and army capacity.",
    "A defense point level needs both its personal defense points and its alliance defense points. Personal defense points are the blue coin and alliance defense points are the gold coin."
